      "content": "i know i should talk to them but i can't get an appointment for like two weeks and i really need to focus for work. i feel like the jitters are just the hyperthyroidism acting up anyway. like, if i just take a slightly smaller dose of the adderall, would that fix it? or is it basically fine to just keep going as usual til i see the doc?",
